  "description": "# SIP2.7: Add 1 Ark to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on arbitrum\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 1 new Ark to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDC Fleet on arbitrum.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional an Ark will enhance the protocol's capabilities on arbitrum.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: arbitrum\n- Fleet Commander: 0x4F63cfEa7458221CB3a0EEE2F31F7424Ad34bb58\n- Number of Ark to add: 1\n\n## New Ark Address\n1. `0x4EF91E09ADb31CC7Ec9b663B6827155D6a103b74`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on arbitrum:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for the Ark\n2. Add the Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip-2-7-integrate-susds-ark-into-arbitrum-usdc-vault/191\n",
